kh2recomp: texture replacement hook (TextureReplacer): the application sees every
completed host -> local transfer and can answer a texture lookup with its own image,
sampled with normalized coordinates over the texel rectangle it stands for, bilinear
(the draw's CBP is passed along to choose among palette variants). GPU writes
(rendering, local -> local copies) are reported so stale images are dropped, and
primitives drawn with a replacement interpolate UVs per sample (TEX_REPLACED_BIT), so
HD UI is not snapped to single-rate pixels. gs/shaders/slangmosh.hpp has to be
regenerated after applying (slangmosh slangmosh.json -O --strip --namespace ParallelGS).

